{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PhotoX Pro 是一款專為追求視覺享受的用戶設計的智能 Wallpaper 應用，提供超過 50 萬張手動精選的高畫質靜態及動態壁紙。該 App 現正進行限時免費活動，讓用戶能以零成本享有原本價值 US $3.99 的完整功能，輕鬆為手機屏幕注入生動活力。</p>\n\n<h2>一鍵將影片轉化為動態桌布</h2>\n<p>PhotoX Pro 的核心優勢在於其強大的影片轉換功能，允許用戶將相冊中的任何影片或從網絡下載的內容即時製成 Live Wallpapers。操作過程流暢且節省記憶體，用戶可自由設定影片長度、關鍵幀並套用藝術濾鏡，配合每日更新的內容庫與內建輕量級編輯器，確保每次喚醒屏幕都能展現獨一無二的個人風格與鮮明色彩。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-138-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-139-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-140-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-141-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-142-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-143-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PhotoX Pro: 4K Live Wallpapers</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T00:37:58.419563+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}